# Mobile app (Expo). Copy to apps/mobile/.env for local overrides.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are bundled into the app: never put secrets here.
#
# Usually leave this unset: the app then uses the same computer Expo runs on
# (Android emulator → 10.0.2.2, iOS simulator / web → localhost, phone with
# Expo Go → the computer's LAN IP from the QR code).
# Set it only when the API runs somewhere else, e.g. a physical phone on the
# same Wi-Fi when auto-detection fails:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:3000
